{
  "name": "人类Human （GGR）",
  "type": "race",
  "img": "icons/environment/people/commoner.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><h3><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">人类</strong></h3><p><em>人类在拉尼卡诸多种族中仅占少数，他们支配着一些公会，在其他公会中则并不突出。与其他世界中一样，人类是革新者、成功者和先驱者，他们的勇气和 适应力使他们能成就伟大的事业——当然也有惨重的失败。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">尽管欧佐夫集团鬼影议会源自人类，但十公会的元祖中没有一个是人类。同样的，目前没有一个公会会长是人类。不过人类在许多公会中担任副官，顾问或策士。他们的野心和干劲驱使着他们上进，但是远古龙，斯芬克斯和恶魔等生物的纯粹力量使人类远离了权力的顶峰。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">拉尼卡的人类与其他世界的人类在身体上并没有多大区别。同样的，他们的倾向也多种多样：他们是唯一一个在所有公会中都存在的种族。</em></p></blockquote><h3></h3><p><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">人类的名字</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">一种特殊的人类语言战胜了所有其他语言，成为拉尼卡的通用语，它的音素和传统塑造了拉尼卡的大多数人类的名字。人类有时会借用其他种族的名字，但是他们有丰富的传统名字可供借鉴。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">姓氏的使用似乎是一种特殊的人类习俗。姓氏是从父母双方传给子女的，有时孩子使用父母双方的姓氏。例如，米歇尔·萨沃德·祖尼奇（Micyl Savod Zunich）是范·祖尼奇（Fann Zunich）和婕德·瓦德·萨沃德（Jarad Vod Savod）的儿子。当其他种族使用姓氏时，他们通常来源于与人类家庭的某种联系（不一定是血缘关系）。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">男用名:</strong> Agmand, Agosto, Bell, Brev, Oars, Dobromir, Dravin, Evern, Gorev，lvos, Janik, Ju ri, Lannos, Lucian, Micas, Nikos, Obez, Olrik,Osidar, Rogad, Sergiu,Sirislav, Tibor, Trigori, Tzaric, Uzric, Valen, Vennick, Viet, Vorimir, Vuliev, Zunak<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">女用名:</strong> Anksa, Aszala, Berta, Bori, Brisks, Dahlya, Geetra, lzolda, Jozica, Lavinia, Luda, Iyzolda, Milana, Miatrl, Nefara, Palla, Pel, Rube,Strava, Sulli, Vina, Voka, Zija<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">姓氏:</strong> Andon, Bara, Bejiri, Borca, Capobar, Forenzad, Gerava, Gharti， Golozar, Gostok, Grezar, Helsk, Javya, Karlaus, Kirescu， Koba, Kos,Macav, Migellic, Nar, Nodov, Pelerine, Pijha, Ralinu， Ringer, Rokiric, Sarv, Shonn, Suszat, Tandris, Trul, Tylver, Valenco, Vay，Vinloskarya, Wenslauv,Yaszen</p><h3>人类特质Human Traits</h3><p>    人类很难一概而论，你的人类角色具有以下种族特质。</p><p><strong>属性值加成Ability Score Increase</strong>。你的全部属性值加1。</p><p><strong>年龄Age</strong>。人类不到20岁成年，而很少活过100 岁。</p><p><strong>阵营Alignment</strong>。人类并不偏向特定阵营。这个种群中存在着最好的人以及最坏的人。</p><p><strong>体型Size</strong>。人类身高差距很大，有的刚好5尺高，而有的甚至高过6尺。不论你有多高，你的体型皆为中型。</p><p><strong>速度Speed</strong>。你的基础步行速度为30尺。</p><p><strong>语言Languages</strong>。你能够说、读、写通用语和一门额外的自选语言。在与他人交流时，人类通常会主动去学习对方的语言，其中也包括了一些晦涩的方言。他们还喜欢在说话时夹杂其他语言的腔调，如兽人粗口，精灵乐调，矮人军号，等等。</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
